{"synopsis":"Segala sesuatu memiliki peringkatnya di dunia ini.\n\nLow, anak pendiam dari Desa Tuwuri kehilangan segalanya akibat kekuatan yang tidak diketahui…\nDesanya musnah tanpa tersisa diakibatkan kekuatan yang hanya dikenal sebagai Pulau Dewa.\n\nKenapa desanya dijadikan target?\nRahasia apa yang tersembunyi dari penghancuran ini?\n\nLow bersumpah dengan angkuhnya demi membongkar kebenaran tentang ini…\n“Aku akan menginjakkan kakiku di Pulau Dewa!”\n\nNamun, ada ketentuan yang sangat berat menantinya, itu karena hanya Ranker Peringkat 10 besar yang diperbolehkan ke sana.\n\nDemi mencapai tujuan ini, Low berangkat mencari Adol, Ksatria Peringkat #1…\nDia memulai perjalanan latihan, pertarungan dan perkembangannya dengen tekad “Aku akan menjadi Ranker #1 dan membongkar kebenarannya!”","alternative_title":"와일드 랭커","author":"SAKAISHI Yusaku, MIZUNO Hikaru","artist":"Park Sungjae","chapters":[{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"726ba22b-71a6-4e9d-a972-581af87d47c7","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-01-05"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"1e5a8461-2ea7-45dd-a68d-faff63279a61","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-01-04"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"b17e68de-5133-4f6b-8602-465fd96aceb9","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-01-03"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"f7d996ee-51eb-497d-8a99-24f978541c77","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-01-02"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"dd4b9713-3e22-4cb8-b1c3-a2c56ef16b0f","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2025-12-31"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"f90f0b59-f317-484c-bfea-c834a7fecf32","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2025-12-30"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"2c777f97-2fcb-4d69-859b-27930acfa16a","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2025-11-10"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"1d1f7958-06e5-462b-b33d-f4ff2b0f98e6","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2025-10-29"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"d2d9d346-c416-46b6-8f87-729b77c023db","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2025-10-28"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20",